   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Sam. Your identity is verified, and I've reviewed order Q-8001 from Burger Barn (bacon cheeseburger and onion rings, $28.03 charged to your Visa ending 4242).\n\nHere's what the courier records show:\n\n- The courier picked up the order at 6:47 PM and arrived at the delivery address at 7:05 PM.\n- The courier called twice (7:06 PM and 7:09 PM) and got no answer.\n- At 7:15 PM the delivery was marked as failed because the customer could not be reached.\n- The order was returned to the restaurant at 7:28 PM.\n\nThe order was never handed over to you. Because the courier couldn't reach you, the policy doesn't allow a refund or account credit for this failed delivery.\n\nIf you believe the courier's information is wrong, or if you didn't get the calls and the address is correct, I can escalate this to a human specialist who will follow up within 24 hours. Would you like me to do that?"
  },
